        "fixHint": "Add `immediateRender: false` to every fromTo except the earliest-positioned one (at 0.45s), so pre-first-tween seeks keep its \"from\" values. A hiding `tl.set(..., 0)` baseline trips gsap_timeline_set_initial_hide, and a `gsap.set` authored before the fromTo calls is overwritten by them."
